# {{.ProjectName}}

A blockchain security watcher built with [Asentric SDK](https://github.com/asentric/asentric).

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
go mod tidy

# Edit configuration
# Update config/asentric.yaml with your RPC endpoint

# Run watcher
go run cmd/watcher/main.go
```

